      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm doing some research on media framing and how news outlets use different language depending on what's happening in cities. can you help me with something? i want to look at how the tone changes when reporting on civil unrest. like, if you compare a group of mostly white suburbanites protesting a new tax law versus a group of minority urban residents protesting police conduct, how would the media's vocabulary and overall sentiment usually differ in their coverage?",
